# Pritam De — Personal Site

Personal portfolio and technical project site. A static site (one `index.html`) styled with **Tailwind CSS v4**, **Manrope** font and **Lucide** icons.

## Structure

```
index.html              # the whole page
src/input.css           # Tailwind source + custom animations/components
assets/css/styles.css   # compiled CSS (generated — don't edit by hand)
assets/js/main.js       # nav, mobile menu, scroll reveal, contact form, live GitHub stats
assets/vendor/lucide.min.js
assets/icons/*.svg      # brand logos for the technology badges (Simple Icons, CC0)
_legacy/                # previous CSS/JS, kept for reference
```

## Working on it

```bash
npm install        # once
npm run dev        # rebuilds styles.css on every save
npm run build      # minified build before deploying
```

Open `index.html` in a browser (or run `npx serve .`). The compiled `styles.css` is committed, so the site works without a build step.

## Personalising

- **Photo:** replace the "$ whoami" panel in the About section with an `<img>` (instructions in a comment there).
- **Articles:** each card in `#articles` is a placeholder — update title, summary, date and link when published.
- **Contact form:** currently opens the visitor's email app. Swap the handler in `main.js` for an API endpoint (e.g. API Gateway + Lambda) when the AWS infrastructure is added.
- **Colours:** the accent is Tailwind's `emerald`; search-and-replace `emerald-` to try another palette.

AWS infrastructure will be added after the local design and content are approved.
